    "created_at": "2022-05-27T17:36:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-05-27T17:36:11Z",
    "body": "A quick update for everyone following this thread: a bugfix to variable processing is going to break the existing workaround in our next release. There is a new workaround [here](https://github.com/starship/starship/pull/3563#issuecomment-1139832534) which involves adding a single line to .zshrc and a custom module into your starship.toml.\r\n\r\nI have a proposal for how to fix this in the long-term, but a full implementation would be breaking, so we likely won't see it in full for a while.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
